{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e3ceda70b4792b262f3ef6d3dc7f9f305b76d12b5e9b715bf6be9cefc6446b49", "ja": "（今日はこのみさんのPV撮影だ。『理想の少女を描く\n狂気の芸術家』という難しい役どころだ……）", "zh": "（今天是木实小姐的PV拍摄。要饰演的是“描绘理想少女的疯狂艺术家”这样一个棘手的角色……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1001_p", "source_sha256": "63160018f3a6a3766cbf8ed57d3d8186ca988009094a6b2ec781471a0bcf5b37", "ja": "このみさん、お疲れさまです。大丈夫ですか？\nかなり苦戦してるみたいですが……。", "zh": "木实小姐，辛苦了。还好吗？\n看起来好像相当不顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "e7e3b3e7832349576012cc132940c968035ecf035831e9131c58b091acccea86", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。\nごめんなさい。私のせいでかなり押してるわよね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n对不起，都怪我，进度已经拖慢很多了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fbd0806ffd74baee18e5b91482ec9b8be5c9d04b93a4d76b40a3700cd12f75e9", "ja": "スケジュールなら大丈夫ですよ。\nそれより、何かありましたか？　体調不良なら……。", "zh": "日程安排没问题。比起这个，是发生什么事了吗？如果身体不舒服的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "789e1bdc76708254bfb515ad21ed5a7a8cdcf8e90a4ce3f58ef48878c464e890", "ja": "ち、違うの！　体調は平気よ。\nむしろ絶好調で……。その……話、聞いてくれる？", "zh": "不、不是！我的身体没问题。\n倒不如说，状态好得不得了……那个……你愿意听我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cd7f2a6f2ac8f5ceea140d629556409443f779648be532ed839225d036836fc5", "ja": "もちろんです。\nなんでも話してください！", "zh": "当然可以。\n请尽管说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "6c86ad3f649f43b4344e53a08930bdc80d5a99e9e45019b62680a5ff672c62a1", "ja": "本当に、どうしようもないことなんだけど……。\n撮影で使ってる化粧品……あれ、本物なの。", "zh": "真的，这件事也实在没办法……  \n拍摄时用的化妆品……那些都是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ce424a38adcd95b8abf30f58fc7882f3253af23a80d9d186f1abd1e6751e350", "ja": "小道具だし、中身は違うと思ったら\nちゃんと本物でビックリしちゃった……。", "zh": "我还以为只是道具，里面装的是别的东西，\n没想到真的是正品，吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aaaa9996a75e4827039d5add698ee85491390a7ba8f9d027c0aead0c77069574", "ja": "それは、監督さんが小物も手を抜きたくない方で……\nって、あれ？　撮影がうまくいかない原因って……。", "zh": "那是因为导演先生连小道具都不愿意马虎……等等，咦？拍摄不顺利的原因该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "ffe7ec95d0dcb4d4234b7936af12e79ddc8cce23f29645d429d0392951f5eabe", "ja": "ええ……。私ね……ここにある化粧品が、\n大体いくらぐらいするのか、わかるの……。", "zh": "嗯……我啊……知道这里的化妆品，大概都要多少钱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "c4e2346fcda766323bfab27b9cecff25d0f05db8500ccf2a101ffec1bd7e1198", "ja": "だから、失敗しちゃいけないって思ったら、\n手が震えて、思うように動けなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "所以，一想到不能失败，手就会发抖，变得没法按自己的想法动起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1011_p", "source_sha256": "056083bf73fb360673bca6d10945193a39d081f77deb457a0dbfd3d2edae3926", "ja": "そうでしたか。小道具を変えることもできますが、\nその緊張を演技に活かしてみませんか？", "zh": "原来如此。虽然也可以更换小道具，但要不要试着把这份紧张感运用到演技中呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "2d767baca8767c68fc6306a0635980b79f61b670e44dc733eb3f7b26ead43cd3", "ja": "緊張を活かす……？\nどういうこと、{$P$}？", "zh": "利用紧张感……？\n什么意思，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a516ae475c14e634ac0c93ea610882bbbde7c565fa8a95693bb4f659999f0bc7", "ja": "このみさんは、芸術家の役です。\n表現したいものがあるからキャンバスに向かってます。", "zh": "好美小姐演的是艺术家的角色。\n因为有想要表达的东西，所以才会面对画布。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3be92170291a77300457df2e5f20edd628a0d9588e40607d7f4b9512e7c014d8", "ja": "理想のイメージを表現する時、きっと興奮してる\nんじゃないかなと。ロコを思い出してみてください。", "zh": "在表现理想形象时，肯定会很兴奋吧。请回想一下ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "6980b7a4e6d725c6ddd1a656ca3924b48e88f2d0917e8d3a5c49844bda403a46", "ja": "興奮……。確かに、閃いた時のロコちゃんは、\n一気に感情が爆発してる気がするわ。", "zh": "兴奋……确实，灵感迸发时的ROCO，感觉情绪一下子就爆发出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "ce3bf62964a57c0ef8ee731680e45465fffae52237feb38b6c6fd9d54800bc9d", "ja": "なるほど。緊張の震えを、喜びや嬉しさの震えに\n置き換えろって言いたいのね。", "zh": "原来如此。你的意思是，要把紧张的颤抖，替换成喜悦和开心的颤抖，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bfe047ecdc0da95e3f2794ba04a24b081fa160ed8b3b04437f621c399f0463d1", "ja": "はい。狂気の芸術家という役柄的にもピッタリです。\nこのみさんなら、うまいこと活かせるはずです！", "zh": "是的。从“疯狂艺术家”这个角色设定来看也非常合适。以木实小姐的能力，应该能很好地发挥这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "725de201289d6049e5dfc4ce2a415b9f89b2ad40b3c19fbdbc94bb7b5c2aaa54", "ja": "そ、そう？　ちょっと強引な気もするけど……。\nでも役柄を深めるためと思えば、アリかしら……？", "zh": "是、是吗？总觉得有点太强硬了……  \n不过，如果是为了深入塑造角色，或许也可以……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ef0561764ecb6c9f936badab759295c8ece2679e3ecc04f1fbfb9167f0934610", "ja": "でもこれは強制じゃありません。\nもし小道具を変えるなら、すぐ相談してきますが……。", "zh": "不过这不是强制要求。要是想更换小道具，就马上来找我商量，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "9938447d377f68e99ad267f3879df9feada6762972b91890d143147c46aca1c3", "ja": "いいえ、その必要はないわ！　ここで\nできないなんて言うのは、アダルティじゃないもの。", "zh": "不，没这个必要！要是在这里说做不到，那可就不够成熟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "24a120f0180e5ace0ee456963995a3eed5a73cf1a15d80256071101afc5aa202", "ja": "それに、監督さんの気持ちもわかるのよ。\nやっぱり本物にしか出せない輝きがあるのよね。", "zh": "而且，我也明白导演的心情。\n果然，只有真正的事物才能绽放出独有的光彩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "e4ffa261baee057652a4a128b3e13fa2cdd18f9b564f5d3933f0272373e6ec3f", "ja": "もう大丈夫よ、{$P$}！\n話を聞いてくれて、ありがとう。私、覚悟を決めたわ！", "zh": "已经没事了，{$P$}！\n谢谢你愿意听我说。我已经下定决心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0304_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "a6772da6f995723846d0564d16052ea132f6c4198eb9d9cfc0c8e54785c378fc", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫よ……。高級コスメだろうと新色だろうと\n……か、かかってきなさい！", "zh": "嗯，没事的……不管是高级化妆品还是新色号……\n……尽管放马过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
